WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.714
This is the capstone. Everything we've covered comes together here.

00:00:25.714 --> 00:00:51.429
Career placement preparation. Review your resume with the career services team.
Practice mock interviews. Research local HVAC employers. Understand the
apprenticeship process: you will work under a licensed journeyman, building OJT

00:00:51.429 --> 00:01:17.143
Here are the key terms. Write these down.

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:42.857
Apprenticeship: Working under a licensed journeyman while building hours toward
your own license.

00:01:42.857 --> 00:02:08.571
Here's why this matters on the job: The program ends but your career is just
beginning. Use every resource available for job placement.

00:02:08.571 --> 00:02:34.286
Watch out for these: Start applying before graduation. And — Use the career
services team

00:02:34.286 --> 00:03:00.000
Take a minute before you move on. What's the one thing from this lesson you need
to remember on a service call?

